          "The sandbox controlled reproduction is representative of the production request mechanism for this operation."
        ]
      },
      {
        "description": "Less likely alternative: a broader Google/provider outage caused lookup failures.",
        "supporting_evidence": [
          "ev_91a2809fd1e4"
