        "confidence": "low",
        "assumptions": [
          "No relevant undeclared tool-executor deployment occurred within the incident window."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "recommended_actions": [
      "Pass the spreadsheet ID instead of the display name for this Sheets operation.",
      "Apply spreadsheet_identifier_kind_remediation: verify callers use the intended spreadsheet ID and validate target/range before execution.",
      "If name-based selection is desired, use a separate supported search/list step before invoking the spreadsheet-ID-only operation.",
      "Collect or expose request validation telemetry earlier in the flow so unsupported identifier kinds fail clearly before queuing."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "The connections and refresh_history queries returned no records, so credential state was not independently corroborated; however no current evidence indicates an auth/refresh failure.",
      "The reproduce evidence is a controlled sandbox observation, not a live production re-execution.",
      "The deployment evidence shows only an unrelated support-dashboard release and does not fully inventory all possible service changes."
